1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,740
一百吨重的火箭，
A one hundred ton rocket

2
00:00:01,740 --> 00:00:03,480
只把一吨多送上天？
that lifts barely more than one ton to orbit?

3
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:06,210
11 月 7 日，民营火箭谷神星二号，
On November 7, the private rocket Ceres-2

4
00:00:06,210 --> 00:00:09,060
把 4 颗卫星送上了五百多公里的轨道。
put four satellites into orbit over 500 km up.

5
00:00:09,060 --> 00:00:10,760
它今年一月首飞失利，
Its first flight failed in January.

6
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:12,240
这次复飞，成了。
This time it worked.

7
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:14,430
可公司自己公布的数字是：
But the company's own numbers:

8
00:00:14,430 --> 00:00:17,090
起飞一百吨，送上天一点三吨。
100 tons at liftoff, 1.3 tons to orbit.

9
00:00:17,090 --> 00:00:18,540
一点三除以一百：
1.3 divided by 100:

10
00:00:18,540 --> 00:00:19,920
百分之一点三。
just 1.3 percent.

11
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:21,190
报道说，这个效率
And reports say that efficiency

12
00:00:21,190 --> 00:00:23,220
在同类火箭里已经算领先。
is world-class for its type.

13
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:26,330
今天的烧脑问题：剩下那九十八吨多，
Today's brain teaser: the other 98-plus tons,

14
00:00:26,330 --> 00:00:27,730
到底干嘛去了？
where did they go?

15
00:00:27,730 --> 00:00:28,980
认识主角：小谷，
Meet our hero, Gu:

16
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:30,970
一百吨重，就为了扔一吨。
a hundred tons, built to throw one.

17
00:00:30,970 --> 00:00:32,940
答案一：绝大部分是燃料，
Answer one: most of it is fuel,

18
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:34,380
几分钟就烧光了。
burned in a few minutes.

19
00:00:34,380 --> 00:00:35,780
为啥要烧这么多？
Why so much?

20
00:00:35,780 --> 00:00:37,480
因为它得跑得飞快。
Because it has to go incredibly fast.

21
00:00:37,480 --> 00:00:39,480
在五百公里高绕地球转，
To circle Earth 500 km up,

22
00:00:39,480 --> 00:00:41,790
速度大约每秒七点六公里。
you need about 7.6 km per second.

23
00:00:41,790 --> 00:00:43,860
这是步枪子弹的七八倍，
Seven or eight times a rifle bullet:

24
00:00:43,860 --> 00:00:46,050
北京到上海，两分多钟。
Beijing to Shanghai in about two minutes.

25
00:00:46,050 --> 00:00:48,000
反转一：难的不是“上去”。
Twist one: going up is not the hard part.

26
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:49,920
五百公里，开车也就半天。
500 km is half a day's drive.

27
00:00:49,920 --> 00:00:51,640
真正难的是横着跑，
The hard part is going sideways,

28
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:54,610
快到一边往下掉，一边绕过地球。
so fast that you fall around the Earth.

29
00:00:54,610 --> 00:00:57,130
就像扔球：扔得越快，落得越远，
Like throwing a ball: faster means farther,

30
00:00:57,130 --> 00:01:00,940
快到地面弯下去的速度追上它，就再也落不了地。
until the ground curves away as fast as it falls.

31
00:01:00,940 --> 00:01:01,990
这就是轨道：
That is an orbit:

32
00:01:01,990 --> 00:01:04,050
一直在掉，永远掉不到。
always falling, never landing.

33
00:01:04,050 --> 00:01:05,640
反转二：燃料越多，
Twist two: more fuel

34
00:01:05,640 --> 00:01:07,340
要推的重量也越多。
means more weight to push.

35
00:01:07,340 --> 00:01:09,480
火箭靠往后喷气往前跑，
A rocket throws gas backward to go forward,

36
00:01:09,480 --> 00:01:12,910
就像在冰面上往后扔球，人就往前滑。
like throwing balls behind you on ice.

37
00:01:12,910 --> 00:01:14,690
可燃料本身也有重量：
But fuel has weight:

38
00:01:14,690 --> 00:01:17,480
多带的燃料，得先把自己推起来。
extra fuel must first lift itself.

39
00:01:17,480 --> 00:01:20,350
这就是火箭方程：速度每多一截，
That is the rocket equation: each step of speed

40
00:01:20,350 --> 00:01:22,380
燃料要成倍地往上翻。
multiplies the fuel you need.

41
00:01:22,380 --> 00:01:24,270
我们按固体火箭粗算：
Our rough estimate for a solid rocket:

42
00:01:24,270 --> 00:01:26,290
要跑出每秒九公里多，
to reach over 9 km per second,

43
00:01:26,290 --> 00:01:29,300
起飞重量得是最后重量的三十倍左右，
liftoff weight must be about 30 times the final weight.

44
00:01:29,300 --> 00:01:31,010
九成七都得是燃料。
97 percent fuel.

45
00:01:31,010 --> 00:01:33,050
可装燃料的壳子加发动机，
But the tanks and engines alone

46
00:01:33,050 --> 00:01:34,860
就远不止那百分之三。
weigh far more than 3 percent.

47
00:01:34,860 --> 00:01:37,310
反转三：所以火箭要边飞边扔。
Twist three: so rockets drop pieces as they fly.

48
00:01:37,310 --> 00:01:40,400
小谷有四节：三级固体，加一级液体。
Gu has four stages: three solid, one liquid.

49
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:41,970
烧空一节，扔一节，
Burn a stage, drop it,

50
00:01:41,970 --> 00:01:44,190
后面就不用背着空罐子跑。
and stop hauling empty tanks.

51
00:01:44,190 --> 00:01:46,570
就像接力赛：跑累的下场，
Like a relay race: the tired runner steps off,

52
00:01:46,570 --> 00:01:48,270
新的那棒接着冲。
a fresh one sprints on.

53
00:01:48,270 --> 00:01:49,350
一棒接一棒，
Leg after leg,

54
00:01:49,350 --> 00:01:52,510
最后把一点三吨推到每秒七点六公里。
until 1.3 tons hits 7.6 km per second.

55
00:01:52,510 --> 00:01:55,690
友情提示：大火箭能做到百分之四左右，
Fine print: big rockets reach around 4 percent;

56
00:01:55,690 --> 00:01:57,230
小火箭普遍更低。
small ones usually less.

57
00:01:57,230 --> 00:01:58,780
液体燃料喷得更快，
Liquid fuel shoots out faster,

58
00:01:58,780 --> 00:02:00,790
同样的燃料能多跑一截。
so the same fuel goes farther.

59
00:02:00,790 --> 00:02:03,460
固体火箭的好处是简单、准备快，
Solid rockets are simple and quick to prepare,

60
00:02:03,460 --> 00:02:05,000
还能在海上发射。
and can even launch from sea.

61
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:06,870
所以那九十八吨去哪了？
So where did the 98 tons go?

62
00:02:06,870 --> 00:02:09,530
大多烧成了气，空壳子掉了回来。
Mostly burned to gas; the empty shells fell back.

63
00:02:09,530 --> 00:02:11,360
下次看到“一箭四星”，
Next time you hear four satellites, one rocket,

64
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:13,490
记得底下有一百吨在帮忙。
remember the hundred tons underneath.

65
00:02:13,490 --> 00:02:14,990
小谷说：我一百吨，
Gu says: I weigh a hundred tons

66
00:02:14,990 --> 00:02:17,500
就为了把这一吨扔得足够快。
just to throw this one ton fast enough.

